Z||000005||BlackDragon||09-02-2001||08:45 PM||||stupid question but here goes. how well does that car perform? takeoff, corners? the blue car i mean. also, what kind of trans do you have? what kind of power does it have? im planning on building something similar, but im thinking of adding a few more mods. i think, but im not sure what mods you have. beautiful car. your car is what turned me on to fastbacks. i never used to like them. then i saw yours with the chop.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> drool<P>------------------<BR>im looking for a inexpensive black standard fastback. does not have to run. does not have to look good. only the mid section needs to be dent free. the fenders,bumpers, dont have to be in good cond. faded paint is fine. anyone who has info, email me. grey interior would be nice but beggars cant be choosers||||reg||1
